 slowly gets dirty during your shift. If you don't sweep, it won't look great by the end of the ni","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:59:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692889","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4307390-1846018067944330","game_id":"steam-4307390","kind":"announcement","title":"Cursed Gas Station Demo is Out Now!","summary":"Your first nights on the job It's the 1990s. You are Cole, the new night-shift worker at an isolated gas station. The demo covers his arrival and his first two shifts. Work the register, fuel the cars, restock the shelves, and deal with whoever pulls in off the road.As the nights go on, the routine starts to break. A conversation turns into an argument, and small details start to feel wrong.Steam Next Fest The demo will stay playable throughout Steam Next Fest, October 19–26.Wishlist Cursed Gas ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T15:00:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944330","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4307390-1844751498230781","game_id":"steam-4307390","kind":"announcement","title":"Cursed Gas Station Demo Arrives October 13","summary":"The lights are on. The register is open. The road outside is quiet.For now.I'm happy to share that the Cursed Gas Station demo launches on Steam on October 13, free to play.Your first nights on the job You are Cole, the new night-shift worker at an isolated gas station in the 1990s. The demo covers his arrival and his first two shifts. Work the register, fuel the cars, restock the shelves, and deal with whoever pulls in off the road.When the routine breaks As the nights go on, the job starts to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T07:40:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230781","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4307390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4307390":"2026-10-26T12:06:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4307390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:44Z"},"4348840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:45Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4307390","app_id":4307390,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c7a5d754c285f8222a332e099b46959eee0fa8c56d4b5b35d2a767aea0237bae","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"1990년대의 외딴 주유소에서 콜은 머물 방이 제공되는 야간 근무 일을 맡습니다. 손님을 응대하는 동안, 이 심리 공포 게임에서는 설명할 수 없는 사건들이 벌어지기 시작합니다.","publishers":[{"name":"PlayWay S.A.","creator_clan_account_id":33701576}],"developers":[{"name":"Wisold Games","creator_clan_account_id":46204491}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1806476400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Demo Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791013577","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4307390/2013091685/5515198bd6cbd92fed92d